Homepage: https://github.com/Isaacpaezz/leakguard
Description: VPN kill switch for the services you choose
 When your VPN drops, the services you choose, such as Claude, go offline
 instead of leaking through your real connection. The rest of the computer
 keeps working normally.
 .
 leakguard allows traffic to the protected services only through the VPN
 interface, with nftables rules kept by a systemd service. A tray icon shows
 whether you are protected, with one checkbox per service and a 3-step setup.
